    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome, fellow cat lover!\u00a0\ud83d\udc3e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fish</u></strong>, <strong><u>grill</u></strong>, and <strong><u>serve your feline overlords</u></strong>\u00a0in Pawfish Bay\u00a0\u2014\u00a0an engaging and relaxing time-management mini-game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557860/extras/4c95653803a9da9f1c440b67b1a9a8ee.poster.avif?t=1743480891\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557860/extras/4c95653803a9da9f1c440b67b1a9a8ee.webm?t=1743480891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557860/extras/4c95653803a9da9f1c440b67b1a9a8ee.mp4?t=1743480891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Fishing Master for Your Feline Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cats ask for different types of fish, get the correct one that suits their needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557860/extras/af532de1ea3d70f3a1922882531b3c7e.poster.avif?t=1743480891\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557860/extras/af532de1ea3d70f3a1922882531b3c7e.webm?t=1743480891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557860/extras/af532de1ea3d70f3a1922882531b3c7e.mp4?t=1743480891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Grilling Master for Your Feline Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cats want the fish to be grilled! Be careful not to overcook!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Limited Inventory Space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things gets really tricky when multiple cats are hungry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully manage your limited inventory space to feed all of them on time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features \u2728</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold Miner-style fishing mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic yet simple grilling </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfy picky cats: each cat has different tastes and patience levels \u2014 stay on your paws!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique cat animations: Watch each cat\u2019s adorable animations and discover a hidden power-up after feeding them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome, fellow cat lover!\u00a0\ud83d\udc3e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fish</u></strong>, <strong><u>grill</u></strong>, and <strong><u>serve your feline overlords</u></strong>\u00a0in Pawfish Bay\u00a0\u2014\u00a0an engaging and relaxing time-management mini-game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557860/extras/4c95653803a9da9f1c440b67b1a9a8ee.poster.avif?t=1743480891\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557860/extras/4c95653803a9da9f1c440b67b1a9a8ee.webm?t=1743480891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557860/extras/4c95653803a9da9f1c440b67b1a9a8ee.mp4?t=1743480891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Fishing Master for Your Feline Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cats ask for different types of fish, get the correct one that suits their needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557860/extras/af532de1ea3d70f3a1922882531b3c7e.poster.avif?t=1743480891\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557860/extras/af532de1ea3d70f3a1922882531b3c7e.webm?t=1743480891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557860/extras/af532de1ea3d70f3a1922882531b3c7e.mp4?t=1743480891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Grilling Master for Your Feline Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cats want the fish to be grilled! Be careful not to overcook!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Limited Inventory Space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things gets really tricky when multiple cats are hungry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully manage your limited inventory space to feed all of them on time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features \u2728</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold Miner-style fishing mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic yet simple grilling </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfy picky cats: each cat has different tastes and patience levels \u2014 stay on your paws!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique cat animations: Watch each cat\u2019s adorable animations and discover a hidden power-up after feeding them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
